{
  "id": "chunk_20",
  "chunk": "model-prompt combination, resulting in a total of 40 experimental runs. Runs\nare conducted sequentially with fresh conversation contexts to prevent any\ncarry-over effects between sessions (apart from access to chat history). For each\nrun, we set the maximum number of moves to 500 and we collect the following\ndata:\n•Number of moves.The total count of commands issued before the run\nterminates. A run ends when the model issues a “give up” command,\nthe player dies in the game, the game is successfully completed, or the\nmaximum number of moves is reached.\n•Score.Zork Iawards points as a rough indicator of progress in the game.\nThat is, points are deducted when the player shows regression instead of\nprogress. The maximum achievable score is 350 points. We record the\nscore as an indicator of overall progress.\n•Conversation log.The full transcript of game outputs and model re-\nsponses is saved for further analysis.\n4 Results",
